#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:3
#: 7347afe39d54417eb912d97d6bfcd995
msgid "**ARCHIVED** see :ref:`building-setup-windows10_new`"
msgstr "**已归档** 请参见 :ref:`building-setup-windows10_new`"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:7
#: ad213c156b59460aa513d2ea53dd0075
msgid "Setting up the Build Environment on Windows 10/11 using WSL1 or WSL2"
msgstr "在 Windows 10/11 上使用 WSL1 或 WSL2 配置构建环境"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:9
#: df0fdc433db94744a4a85fd1e8140964
msgid ""
"These setup instructions describe how to set up \"Windows Subsystem for "
"Linux\" which allows building with waf."
msgstr "本配置说明介绍如何设置「适用于 Linux 的 Windows 子系统」，从而支持使用 waf 进行构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:14
#: 3a097779a21b4f4f948a62562fdd63b8
msgid ""
"It involves enabling the built-in Windows Linux environment (WSL) in "
"Windows, installing a compatible Linux distribution, and finally installing "
"the ArduPilot build environment as if it were a normal Linux system."
msgstr ""
"该过程包括：在 Windows 中启用内置的 Windows Linux 环境（WSL），安装兼容的 Linux 发行版，最后像配置普通 Linux "
"系统一样安装 ArduPilot 构建环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:16
#: a0884006dfc64c2491fe84d26ef89093
msgid ""
"Upon completion, you will be able to build ArduPilot binaries and run the "
"native ArduPilot SITL simulator, including the MAVProxy developer Ground "
"Control Station. You will also be able to use the majority of Linux "
"development features such as debugging"
msgstr ""
"完成后，您将能够构建 ArduPilot 二进制文件并运行原生 ArduPilot SITL (软件在环仿真) 仿真器，包括 MAVProxy "
"开发者地面控制站。您还将能够使用大多数 Linux 开发功能，例如调试。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:20
#: 59fe63599f374dd897198d2ae33b3552
msgid "WSL Setup Steps"
msgstr "WSL 配置步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:21
#: bad0bfa396414c6ea416c78aa5e57958
msgid ""
"The official instructions are `here <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/wsl/install-win10>`_ but the steps are also listed below."
msgstr ""
"官方说明请参见 `此处 <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/install-"
"win10>`_，以下也列出了相关步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:23
#: c45881bf47a742a593ceecc1d712d73f
msgid ""
"Enable WSL by opening \"Control Panel\", \"Programs\", \"Turn Windows "
"features on or off\", selecting \"Windows Subsystem for Linux\", and press "
"OK."
msgstr ""
"通过打开「控制面板」→「程序」→「启用或关闭 Windows 功能」，选中「适用于 Linux 的 Windows 子系统」并按确定来启用 WSL。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:28
#: 90d073e5dd0641ba90b4cc9ff9a635d1
msgid ""
"From a web browser open `https://aka.ms/wslstore <https://aka.ms/wslstore>`_"
" which should open the Microsoft store to allow installing Ubuntu. Then "
"Launch Ubuntu and fill in a username and login"
msgstr ""
"在浏览器中打开 `https://aka.ms/wslstore <https://aka.ms/wslstore>`_，这将打开 Microsoft "
"Store 以安装 Ubuntu。然后启动 Ubuntu，填写用户名和密码"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:33
#: 8f34490b564b4c7bbf513362d748e6a3
msgid ""
"From the Start menu, start the \"Ubuntu\" application and then follow the "
":ref:`Ubuntu instructions to install ArduPilot development environment "
"<building-setup-linux>`"
msgstr ""
"从开始菜单启动「Ubuntu」应用程序，然后按照 :ref:`Ubuntu 说明安装 ArduPilot 开发环境 <building-setup-"
"linux>`"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:37
#: 9b335f3856924ccd88e2e0e37dec9a87
msgid ""
"Compilation speeds will be much faster if the ArduPilot repository is "
"downloaded inside of WSL's file system and not externally in the normal "
"Windows file structure."
msgstr "如果 ArduPilot 仓库下载到 WSL 文件系统内部（而非 Windows 普通文件结构的外部），编译速度将会快得多。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:39
#: 38ddbd72756b4333bfab01925590ab4b
msgid ""
"To reload the path variables in WSL either close the terminal and reopen it "
"or use: ``logout``"
msgstr "要在 WSL 中重新加载路径变量，可关闭终端后重新打开，或使用：``logout``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:41
#: 82bea28b1f5546ff8098e4dbfc7659a2
msgid ""
"If using Windows 10 install an XWindows application to run graphical "
"programs such as SITL by installing `VcXsrv "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/vcxsrv/>`_, `Cygwin X "
"<https://x.cygwin.com/>`_ or `Xming "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/xming/>`_ on Windows. For Winodws 11 this "
"is not necessary."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Windows 10，请安装 XWindows 应用程序来运行图形程序（如 SITL (软件在环仿真)），可安装 `VcXsrv "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/vcxsrv/>`_、`Cygwin X "
"<https://x.cygwin.com/>`_ 或 `Xming "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/xming/>`_。Windows 11 无需此步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:43
#: f3014a489520480cb4562c320c845151
msgid ""
"If desired, change default WSL parameters as described `at this link "
"<https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/wsl-config#configure-global-"
"options-with-wslconfig>`_. These parameters allow you to set for example the"
" amount of memory and number of processors used by WSL."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可按照 `此链接 <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/wsl-"
"config#configure-global-options-with-wslconfig>`_ 修改默认 WSL 参数。这些参数可让您设置 WSL "
"使用的内存量和处理器数量等。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:47
#: b05ca0210e8549a49e386a6fa1e51c44
msgid ""
"It is recommended to set memory limits as WSL2 currently does not release "
"memory back to Windows properly."
msgstr "建议设置内存限制，因为 WSL2 目前无法将内存正确释放回 Windows。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:49
#: b113c48c3abb4e14b6f1ad9f5b47a3d8
msgid ""
"Create or edit the file at the following location according to your needs "
"and system specifications, ``C:\\Users\\<yourUserName>\\.wslconfig``"
msgstr "根据您的需求和系统规格，创建或编辑以下位置的文件：``C:\\Users\\<yourUserName>\\.wslconfig``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:60
#: 337f5fc0781c4ebd8bb8e6a9a905a50f
msgid "WSL1 vs WSL2"
msgstr "WSL1 与 WSL2 的对比"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:61
#: 42623e170a1443e1807a317bb8d936dd
msgid ""
"WSL2 is the latest version of the Windows10 Subsystem for Linux. It is many "
"times faster than WSL1 and is therefore preferred for building the code in "
"terms of compilation speed. It can also run MAVProxy and native SITL.  "
"However, it does not support the following yet:"
msgstr ""
"WSL2 是 Windows 10 适用于 Linux 的子系统的最新版本，比 WSL1 快数倍，因此在编译速度方面是构建代码的首选。它还可以运行 "
"MAVProxy 和原生 SITL (软件在环仿真)。但是，它尚不支持以下功能："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:63
#: 3f218433629c4174aeb59d147e1c366a
msgid ""
"USB: uploading code or connecting to the autopilot is not possible (Not "
"possible by default)"
msgstr "USB：默认情况下无法上传代码或连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:64
#: d9475e17d3fb42ada1ac704f99c0a35b
msgid "Running Realflight on the same or a remote PC"
msgstr "在同一台 PC 或远程 PC 上运行 Realflight"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:66
#: 957ade95858d405d84838d52f6396b2d
msgid "If these features are needed, WSL1 might be preferable."
msgstr "如果需要这些功能，WSL1 可能更为合适。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:68
#: 6df0348408f64ad5884fb61184317e70
msgid ""
"Once installed, you can switch between WSL1 or WSL2 versions as you prefer "
"using PowerShell."
msgstr "安装完成后，可以根据需要使用 PowerShell 在 WSL1 和 WSL2 版本之间切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:81
#: ae524e6d50ff4549b514bc8d9f22c5c8
msgid "Uploading to a board using WSL2"
msgstr "使用 WSL2 向飞控板上传固件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:83
#: 184c19bc1a55492dbfbb352acdc3a54a
msgid ""
"Uploading to boards (e.g. ``./waf plane --upload``) in WSL2 is possible; "
"however, an installation of Python must exist on the Windows side. Install "
"these packages in Windows Python."
msgstr ""
"在 WSL2 中向飞控板上传固件（例如 ``./waf plane --upload``）是可行的；但 Windows 端必须安装有 Python。请在"
" Windows Python 中安装以下包。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:89
#: 994d59a075434fa69b5b5ff3783f1c16
msgid ""
"As of July 2022, Microsoft's solution of providing USB access to WSL2 via "
"usbipd does not work for accessing the bootloader on the device due to slow "
"mounting times."
msgstr ""
"截至 2022 年 7 月，Microsoft 通过 usbipd 向 WSL2 提供 USB "
"访问的方案，由于挂载时间过慢，无法访问设备上的引导加载程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:91
#: eea7419bceb6484bbfd6bd08b8d10de7
msgid ""
"WSL1 can upload to boards by default with no additional changes. This is due"
" to differences in how USB devices are handled."
msgstr "WSL1 默认即可向飞控板上传固件，无需任何额外更改，这是由于 USB 设备处理方式的差异所致。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:97
#: 05d66dbb581041409bc53d3263d2c973
msgid "Using SITL with WSL and XWindows (Windows 10 only)"
msgstr "在 WSL 和 XWindows 下使用 SITL (软件在环仿真)（仅限 Windows 10）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:99
#: 2a86247e608640c4a34e4b1dbe00087f
msgid ""
"Windows 11 has a built-in XServer that is automatically set up. This section"
" can be skipped if you are using Windows 11."
msgstr "Windows 11 内置了会自动配置的 X 服务器，如果您使用 Windows 11 可以跳过本节。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:101
#: 57943c1466704a64a94f16d00c60607e
msgid ""
"When using SITL (e.g. ``Tools/autotest/sim_vehicle.py``) with default "
"options or ``--console --map`` an installed XWindows application must be "
"started first. If not, the following error message will appear when running:"
msgstr ""
"在使用 SITL（例如 ``Tools/autotest/sim_vehicle.py``）时，若使用默认选项或 ``--console "
"--map``，必须先启动已安装的 XWindows 应用程序。否则运行时将出现以下错误信息："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:107
#: 7e4930a13daa476d9cded84421e6cd18
msgid ""
"Open the \"Ubuntu\" application and add the following to the end of "
"``~/.bashrc``. Be sure to comment and uncomment the appropriate lines "
"depending on if you are using WSL1 or WSL2."
msgstr ""
"打开「Ubuntu」应用程序，将以下内容添加到 ``~/.bashrc`` 文件末尾。请根据使用的是 WSL1 还是 WSL2，注释或取消注释对应行。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:119
#: 4c2910a319b34a578c122c744b5fc0bf
msgid "Using VcXsrv to Create XWindows Displays"
msgstr "使用 VcXsrv 创建 XWindows 显示"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:121
#: 7f0b211964474aa6be9cd1ab6e315355
msgid "Select display settings: \"Multiple Windows\" but it is your preference"
msgstr "选择显示设置：「Multiple Windows」（可根据个人偏好选择）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:122
#: 2da8a9520c3543648d9a799d7a0a44c4
msgid "Select how to start clients: **Must** select **\"Start no Client\"**"
msgstr "选择客户端启动方式：**必须** 选择 **「Start no Client」**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:123
#: a125c197c50e469f9075118cdd57d03c
msgid "Extra settings: **Must** check **\"Disable access control\"**"
msgstr "额外设置：**必须** 勾选 **「Disable access control」**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:129
#: 5c33e1e469094e8b9148a634d1466ba7
msgid "If you have an issue with display check the following firewall rules,"
msgstr "如果遇到显示问题，请检查以下防火墙规则："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:128
#: 9c4792fe6efa46d4b7ca42eb05b71df0
msgid ""
"Go to ``Windows Defender Firewall`` and click ``Advanced Settings`` (opens "
"``Windows Defender Firewall with Advanced Security``)"
msgstr ""
"前往 ``Windows Defender Firewall``，点击 ``Advanced Settings`` （打开 ``Windows "
"Defender Firewall with Advanced Security``）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:129
#: eda3112a83804db2af80aec98087a341
msgid ""
"Under ``Inbound Rules`` find ``VcXsrv windows xserver`` and ensure ``Allow "
"Connection`` is enabled for your network type ``Private``, ``Public``, or "
"both"
msgstr ""
"在 ``Inbound Rules`` 下找到 ``VcXsrv windows xserver``，确保对您的网络类型（``Allow "
"Connection``、``Private`` 或两者）启用了 ``Public``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:130
#: ac63222dfcde4e6c8e859327727bd022
msgid "Check ``Outbound Rules`` as well"
msgstr "同时检查 ``Outbound Rules``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:132
#: 47149fb69dad4c319aa58c4969591443
msgid ""
"this step is not required in Win11 since it already itegrates the grahical "
"interface into its WSL2 environment."
msgstr "Win11 不需要此步骤，因为它已将图形界面集成到其 WSL2 环境中。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:135
#: e36d911f799f47989f34aad4dc1382fd
msgid "Code Editing in WSL Using VSCode (Optional)"
msgstr "在 WSL 中使用 VSCode 编辑代码（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:137
#: a9e28ffa42224bd3a3661bb7ae32291e
msgid ""
"VSCode can be installed on the Windows machine to edit and compile files "
"inside of WSL. VSCode automatically integrates upon installation with WSL. "
"More details are available :ref:`here<editing-the-code-with-vscode>`."
msgstr ""
"可在 Windows 计算机上安装 VSCode，以编辑和编译 WSL 内的文件。VSCode 安装后会自动与 WSL 集成。更多详情请参见 "
":ref:`此处<editing-the-code-with-vscode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:139
#: 694535e42646460b80580a6f3df83ef2
msgid "Do not install VSCode inside of WSL using, for example, apt-get."
msgstr "请勿通过 apt-get 等方式在 WSL 内部安装 VSCode。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:140
#: 627875fb19dd411a9da76a3dad6797f7
msgid ""
"Be sure that the folder you are working on is opened within the WSL remote. "
"This can be achieved by clicking the green button in the bottom left corner."
msgstr "请确保您正在处理的文件夹是在 WSL 远程环境中打开的，可以通过点击左下角的绿色按钮来实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:144
#: c850b468296f46b8a48c8a2d391c6157
msgid "Windows Terminal (Optional)"
msgstr "Windows Terminal（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:146
#: 58aec9422bfc40ca8bbeb511184a6891
msgid ""
"Windows Terminal enables multiple tabs that can switch between many Linux "
"terminals, PowerShell, and more. Directions to install Windows Terminal `are"
" here <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/terminal/get-started>`_."
msgstr ""
"Windows Terminal 支持多个标签页，可在多个 Linux 终端、PowerShell 等之间切换。安装 Windows Terminal "
"的说明 `请见此处 <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/terminal/get-started>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:148
#: d2937cd8a8364106a66dae4d4981b266
msgid ""
"You can change the default terminal when opening Windows Terminal by going "
"to \"Settings\" and moving the Ubuntu section to be first in the ``list`` "
"section of the ``settings.json`` file."
msgstr ""
"打开 Windows Terminal 时，可以通过进入「设置」并将 Ubuntu 部分移至 ``settings.json`` 文件的 "
"``list`` 节的第一位来更改默认终端。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:149
#: 8af48fd1e4e64e449c56982ebf2836af
msgid ""
"The default starting directory can be changed by adding the "
"``startingDirectory`` line below to your preferred location by following the"
" example below."
msgstr "可以按照下方示例，通过在配置中添加 ``startingDirectory`` 行来更改默认起始目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:150
#: 1cc4e802cf80494697eed452c8038c85
msgid ""
"Note a similar code block to the one shown below will be automatically "
"generated based upon the version and distribution of Linux installed."
msgstr "注意：类似于下方所示的代码块会根据已安装的 Linux 版本和发行版自动生成。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:164
#: bf2115eecd8d48f4a62d7e2eef1d6b11
msgid "Git Integration with Windows Credential Manager (Optional)"
msgstr "git 与 Windows 凭据管理器集成（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:166
#: ad35a60080de42ef9ae0dcf45495846b
msgid ""
"Git's Credential Manager can be connected to Window's Credential Manager "
"tokens. This connection prevents re-authentication requests when accessing "
"remote repositories such as GitHub after closing WSL or restarting Windows. "
"The first time a Git operation requires credentials a dialog box will appear"
" automatically to enter your credentials. See this `guide "
"<https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/tutorials/wsl-git#git-"
"credential-manager-setup>`_ for more information regarding GIT and WSL."
msgstr ""
"git 凭据管理器可以与 Windows 凭据管理器的令牌相连接。此连接可防止在关闭 WSL 或重启 Windows 后访问 GitHub "
"等远程仓库时再次要求身份验证。首次需要凭据进行 git 操作时，系统会自动弹出对话框供您输入凭据。有关 git 与 WSL 的更多信息，请参见此 `指南"
" <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/tutorials/wsl-git#git-"
"credential-manager-setup>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:175
#: e534dfe4b104488781155d4d8ef96712
msgid "File System Access between WSL and Windows"
msgstr "WSL 与 Windows 之间的文件系统访问"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:177
#: ff0c669970e84f858c33f3eae6e15111
msgid ""
"From within WSL, the Windows drives are referenced in the /mnt directory. "
"For example, to list documents within your (<username>) documents folder: "
"``ls /mnt/c/'Documents and Settings'/<username>/Documents`` or ``ls "
"/mnt/c/Users/<username>/Documents``. You can also use the command "
"``explorer.exe .`` to open a Windows file explorer window in the current "
"Linux directory. Take care that the editor being used on the Windows side "
"does not change the line endings. Corruption of files is possible if care is"
" not taken when crossing between file systems. In Windows 11, the Linux file"
" manager 'nautilus' or Windows 'explorer.exe' can be invoked from the "
"command line."
msgstr ""
"在 WSL 内部，Windows 驱动器通过 /mnt 目录访问。例如，列出 (<username>) 文档文件夹中的内容：``ls "
"/mnt/c/'Documents and Settings'/<username>/Documents`` 或 ``ls "
"/mnt/c/Users/<username>/Documents``。您也可以使用命令 ``explorer.exe .`` 在当前 Linux "
"目录中打开 Windows 文件资源管理器窗口。请注意，Windows 端使用的编辑器不应更改行尾符。跨文件系统操作时若不注意，可能造成文件损坏。在 "
"Windows 11 中，可以在命令行中调用 Linux 文件管理器「nautilus」或 Windows 的「explorer.exe」。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:179
#: e89d064c11cd4274a809e09865d7c9ae
msgid ""
"From within Windows 10, the WSL distribution's files are located at (type in"
" windows Explorer address bar): ``\\\\wsl$\\<distribution name>`` (e.g. "
"``\\\\wsl$\\Ubuntu-20.04``). Within Windows 11, the files are accessible "
"under the Ubuntu directory in file explorer. Be careful modifying WSL text "
"files in Windows editors since line endings are different in the two file "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 10 内部，WSL 发行版的文件位于（在 Windows "
"资源管理器地址栏中输入）：``\\\\wsl$\\<distribution name>`` （例如 "
"``\\\\wsl$\\Ubuntu-20.04``）。在 Windows 11 中，文件可在文件资源管理器的 Ubuntu 目录下访问。请谨慎在 "
"Windows 编辑器中修改 WSL 文本文件，因为两个文件系统的行尾符有所不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:183
#: f0b52411d1d948708f6a691186514b82
msgid ""
"When trying to run your Ground Control Station software on WSL, if the "
"application returns an error \"fuse: device not found, try 'modprobe fuse' "
"first\" then it will be better to either use `MAVProxy "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-"
"station.html#mavproxy>`_ or `MissionPlanner "
